###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The 0.076 eV/A value is quoted in the text as 'the value shown in Fig. 8(c)' and taken as the R_fix = 5.82 A point; the dependence on R_fix is a figure. The Au-MgO test (forces on Au atoms against DFT and the 4G-HDNNP) is a figure and has no metric.
# - Not encoded: the point-charge toy models (SevenNet and MACE, 5 layers; an analytic reference, not a quantum-mechanical one), the atomic-energy mapping analysis and the Sr metal test of SevenNet-0. Table 1 compares these toy settings with SevenNet-0 and MACE-MP-0.
# - numFeatures of the SrO model is not stated. Read from the arXiv v3 preprint.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

